---
import '../../styles/v3-pages.css';
import V3CommercialHeader from '../../components/V3CommercialHeader.astro';
import V3CommercialFooter from '../../components/V3CommercialFooter.astro';
import V3Seo from '../../components/V3Seo.astro';
import { publishedV3BlogPosts } from '../../data/v3-blog';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const articleUrl = (slug: string) => `${base}blog/${slug}/`;
const featured = publishedV3BlogPosts.find((post) => post.featured) ?? publishedV3BlogPosts[0];
const rest = publishedV3BlogPosts.filter((post) => post.slug !== featured?.slug);
const categoryLabel = { operativa: 'Operativa', mantenimiento: 'Mantenimiento', digitalizacion: 'Digitalización', activos: 'Activos' } as const;
const formatDate = (value: string) => new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-ES', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }).format(new Date(`${value}T12:00:00`));
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <V3Seo title="Blog · IsiVoltPro" description="Ideas prácticas sobre mantenimiento, órdenes de trabajo, activos, QR, preventivo y digitalización para autónomos y pequeñas empresas." path={`${base}blog/`} />
  <style is:inline>
    .blog-hero{padding:76px 0 68px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 77% 18%,rgba(102,83,220,.12),transparent 27%),radial-gradient(circle at 91% 66%,rgba(42,188,141,.09),transparent 20%),#fff}.blog-hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:58px;align-items:center}.blog-hero h1{margin:14px 0 18px;font:800 clamp(48px,5.2vw,72px)/.98 var(--v3-font-display,system-ui);letter-spacing:-.06em}.blog-hero h1 span{display:block;color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6754df,#4b9ed5 50%,#2fba8c);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text}.blog-hero p{max-width:610px;margin:0;color:#717d91;line-height:1.72}.blog-featured{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:0;border:1px solid #e5e9f1;border-radius:28px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 28px 70px rgba(55,64,103,.12)}.blog-featured__media{min-height:330px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f2efff,#f4fbff 52%,#eefaf5)}.blog-featured__media img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.blog-featured__copy{padding:28px}.blog-kicker{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;color:#6a58d9;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase}.blog-kicker time{color:#8b95a7;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none}.blog-featured h2{margin:14px 0 12px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.045em}.blog-featured p{margin:0;color:#737f92;font-size:13px;line-height:1.62}.blog-link{display:inline-flex;margin-top:18px;color:#5647cf;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.blog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.blog-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100%;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(55,64,103,.05)}.blog-card__media{height:190px;background:#f7f8fc}.blog-card__media img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.blog-card__body{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;padding:19px}.blog-card h3{margin:10px 0 9px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em}.blog-card p{margin:0;color:#778297;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.blog-card .blog-link{margin-top:auto;padding-top:17px}.blog-method{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}.blog-method article{padding:20px;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#fafbff)}.blog-method b{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;margin-bottom:13px;border-radius:10px;background:#f1efff;color:#6550dc}.blog-method strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.blog-method p{margin:6px 0 0;color:#788398;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}@media(max-width:920px){.blog-hero__grid,.blog-featured{grid-template-columns:1fr}.blog-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.blog-featured__media{min-height:280px}}@media(max-width:620px){.blog-hero{padding:54px 0}.blog-hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,13vw,58px)}.blog-grid,.blog-method{grid-template-columns:1fr}.blog-featured__copy{padding:22px}.blog-featured h2{font-size:26px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<V3CommercialHeader />
<main class="page-main">
  <section class="blog-hero"><div class="page-shell blog-hero__grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Blog IsiVoltPro</span><h1>Ideas para trabajar mejor,<span>antes de venderte nada.</span></h1><p>Contenido práctico sobre mantenimiento, órdenes de trabajo, activos, preventivo y digitalización. Cada artículo parte de un problema operativo concreto y termina con una acción que puedes probar.</p></div>{featured && <article class="blog-featured"><div class="blog-featured__media"><img src={`${base}${featured.image.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`} alt={featured.imageAlt} width="960" height="540" /></div><div class="blog-featured__copy"><div class="blog-kicker"><span>{categoryLabel[featured.category]}</span><time datetime={featured.publishedAt}>{formatDate(featured.publishedAt)}</time></div><h2>{featured.title}</h2><p>{featured.excerpt}</p><a class="blog-link" href={articleUrl(featured.slug)}>Leer artículo →</a></div></article>}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section page-section--soft"><div class="page-shell"><div class="page-section__head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Últimos artículos</span><h2>Menos teoría.<br/><span class="gradient-text">Más contexto útil.</span></h2></div><p>El blog complementa las guías de Recursos: aquí desarrollamos problemas frecuentes, decisiones de campo y formas de ordenar el trabajo sin convertirlo en burocracia.</p></div><div class="blog-grid">{rest.map((post) => <article class="blog-card"><div class="blog-card__media"><img src={`${base}${post.image.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`} alt={post.imageAlt} loading="lazy" width="960" height="540" /></div><div class="blog-card__body"><div class="blog-kicker"><span>{categoryLabel[post.category]}</span><time datetime={post.publishedAt}>{formatDate(post.publishedAt)}</time></div><h3>{post.title}</h3><p>{post.excerpt}</p><a class="blog-link" href={articleUrl(post.slug)}>Leer artículo →</a></div></article>)}</div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="page-shell"><div class="page-section__head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Línea editorial</span><h2>Un contenido base,<br/><span class="gradient-text">varios canales.</span></h2></div><p>La estructura V3 ya separa el artículo original de sus adaptaciones para Instagram, Facebook y LinkedIn. La publicación externa seguirá bloqueada hasta conectar un backend autorizado.</p></div><div class="blog-method"><article><b>01</b><strong>Problema real</strong><p>Partimos de una situación concreta de mantenimiento, no de una palabra clave vacía.</p></article><article><b>02</b><strong>Artículo útil</strong><p>El blog conserva la explicación completa, SEO, enlaces internos y contexto.</p></article><article><b>03</b><strong>Adaptación social</strong><p>Cada red recibe una versión propia y queda pendiente de aprobación antes de publicar.</p></article></div></div></section>
</main>
<V3CommercialFooter />
</body>
</html>
